Suggested fixes
  1. Menus do not depend on hover [hover-only-menus, weight 3]
     Expose submenus through a <button aria-expanded> toggle, or render submenu links in the
     page (footer sitemap) so they are reachable without hover.
  2. WebMCP tools declare safety annotations [webmcp-tool-annotations, weight 3]
     Add annotations: { readOnlyHint: true } for read tools and { consequentialHint: true } for
     mutating tools; do not use toolautosubmit on consequential forms.
  3. Site search is exposed [search-available, weight 1]
     Expose search as <form role="search"> with a labelled <input type="search">, and declare a
     SearchAction in WebSite JSON-LD.
  4. Downloads and new windows are announced [download-and-popup-links, weight 1]
     Say "(PDF)", "(download)" or "(opens in new tab)" in the link text or aria-label.

